{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年38歲的港姐冠軍陳庭欣（Toby）去年宣布與拍拖8年的10億富商男友楊振源（Benny）分手，火速搬離沙田九肚山的3000平方呎豪宅，搬回黃大仙500平方呎單位獨居，不再有私人司機及七人車接送，自己揸車出入。陳庭欣回復單身後即刻與「金牌媒人」阿Bob一同去拜狐仙求姻緣，又獲阿Bob介紹匹克球場主，雖然她透露同對方幾啱傾又合眼緣，但並不心急搵過第二個，但隨後又被指與「東張男神」曾錦燊（Charles）過從甚密，疑似有新歡。陳庭欣分手後回歸娘家，日前與爸爸打時下流行的匹克球，曬出Fit爆身材！</p><figure><img alt=\"兩人此情不再。(陳庭欣IG圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260106/1085176401956442112275096.jpeg/5cawLoRlKNvgyc9J2eGS4gj1W9lAcEwZXsk_SF7JP0g\"/><figcaption>兩人此情不再。(陳庭欣IG圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣在晚宴上玩匹克球。（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260318/1110979886840811520693147.png/6hO0TKoXA-vZYt3nFD8spSsNktCGeW7wJEvpkSRL6ZE\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣在晚宴上玩匹克球。（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣大騷身材。（ig@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260318/1110979894151876608916378.png/MV3qTcfg_bkr6jfU8dBklibqM9jQ7Ujm2TSVK9k0lSs\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣大騷身材。（ig@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣現時專注工作。(陳順禎攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120765274983895040582904.jpeg/45kLm6WJRDtW08gI_4wUCfpl7NAfvndS9J_LJs6fyyY\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣現時專注工作。(陳順禎攝)</figcaption></figure><p>陳庭欣與爸爸打匹克球騷Fit爆身材</p><p>陳庭欣日前在社交平台分享與爸爸打波片段，她穿上背心及小短裙運動裝，又瘦又Fit，騷出結實身材，Keep得相當之好。陳庭欣透露用了一個月時間與爸爸學識打匹克球，故今可父女檔上陣；而陳庭欣爸爸打波動作靈活，同個女一齊做運動出汗，關係非常好。陳庭欣分手後回到娘家尋慰藉，有家人陪伴，相必情傷很快會復原！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣與爸爸打波！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136434603578757120452906.png/nbr3rEVffwFvJjTqUJ8o_4oHqHiVESh-ZsBUaGbAVGg\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣與爸爸打波！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好開心！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136434600869105664294138.png/Vya-wyWiyxbrrV61UQ65IVnHJyHNS5QAkC_WgZAv1oE\"/><figcaption>好開心！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材好Fit！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136434598360780800907563.png/KRpYAr0N-VNmXxlQB16vygPbHfw0VoFlfgoooH4KKKA\"/><figcaption>身材好Fit！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與家人相處。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136434595827290112031652.png/eW8BNGKndZvYROd1G7WApMWSSZ0977L3aAVrEGgFaxA\"/><figcaption>與家人相處。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣呢套黑綠色泳衣古惑設計相當震撼。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914925215446994944936741.jpeg/fVfJOUJ3ZOTD9kwXuw9ngL7l7mksKNUgV4cKxVeHCsU\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣呢套黑綠色泳衣古惑設計相當震撼。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣呢套黑綠色泳衣古惑設計相當震撼。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914925218940981248276983.jpeg/3fOYVuxVM2k4Jyz1eZ7Ub9AEyp5OItyWtEu5a7RLuWs\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣呢套黑綠色泳衣古惑設計相當震撼。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣近年是大騷司儀必然之選。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914921710686310400356104.png/o2GsEOju5SOEoGKNAPsVwyuLwwed8-bpDs8Z2Q7PGdk\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣近年是大騷司儀必然之選。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣攜帶多套泳衣到馬爾代夫。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914925212452130816862450.jpeg/LF3Mr-Ttzo_Ohg1xPThD7XmD8Hyx2ktNF916MxfdejM\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣攜帶多套泳衣到馬爾代夫。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣攜帶多套泳衣到馬爾代夫。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240923/914925209704730624830529.jpeg/TFzV0PN2DU9QM00BjvToLd0bwHsW-0BxtylaabcpWmk\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣攜帶多套泳衣到馬爾代夫。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣快閃泰國享受陽光與海灘。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240902/907324490831499264876493.png/NpPd5xZ20feERceT8zaIJcVltWli0TvANqHwkTah8JE\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣快閃泰國享受陽光與海灘。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣快閃泰國享受陽光與海灘。（IG：@toby_yanyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240902/907324493138497536186359.png/gw1A1OEyy0G8agxve2uOH0foJJLQktkYJdrlUSXa5VE\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣快閃泰國享受陽光與海灘。（IG：@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣。(梁碧玲 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240829/905978267516014592354192.jpeg/fctGeTWp2eQ7O88az3GL0CZfnRzNRP1wiwJOebECTnk\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣。(梁碧玲 攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T17:19:07.079609+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":805,"images":16,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}